  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51694df133d8099a",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴向大家介绍 aMUSEd，这是一种高效的非扩散式文本生成图像模型。之所以取这个名字，是因为它是 Google 的 MUSE 的开放复现版本。aMUSEd 的生成质量并非最佳，我们此次发布的是采用宽松许可证的研究预览版。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4acce808ce3f7a6",
      "translationZh": "与常用的潜在扩散方法（Rombach 等人，2022）不同，aMUSEd 采用了掩码图像模型（Masked Image Model，MIM）方法。正如 Chang 等人（2023）指出的那样，这不仅需要更少的推理步数，还能增强模型的可解释性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c7f4d1713d2dadc",
      "translationZh": "与 MUSE 一样，aMUSEd 展现出了仅凭单张图像进行风格迁移的出色能力，Sohn 等人（2023）对这一特性进行了深入研究。这一特性有望为个性化和特定风格的图像生成开辟新的途径。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5ff68dcc66e034a",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将介绍 aMUSEd 的一些内部机制，展示如何使用它完成包括文本生成图像在内的不同任务，以及如何对它进行微调。在此过程中，我们将提供与 aMUSEd 相关的所有重要资源，包括其训练代码。让我们开始吧 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e331da0741fb6d05",
      "translationZh": "目录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3f15799af503a46",
      "translationZh": "它是如何工作的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f089d3fc61cbc1b",
      "translationZh": "在 diffusers 中使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e1a7c84bde3e6cd",
      "translationZh": "微调 aMUSEd",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69b1b67de5ef98be",
      "translationZh": "局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7844c112bc6129de",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了一个演示，供读者体验 aMUSEd。你可以在这个 Space 中试用，也可以在下方嵌入的交互体验区中试用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f15799af503a46",
      "translationZh": "它是如何工作的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6079e3b6bf677e6d",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd 基于掩码图像建模。它为社区提供了一个很有吸引力的用例，让大家能够在图像生成场景中探索那些已知在语言建模中有效的组件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b476a1e640139692",
      "translationZh": "下图以图示方式概述了 aMUSEd 的工作原理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24be39074c97d209",
      "translationZh": "训练期间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "948b3068aeaf6da0",
      "translationZh": "使用 VQGAN 对输入图像进行词元化，得到图像词元",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7bb3669a0f6464fb",
      "translationZh": "然后，按照余弦掩码调度对图像词元进行掩码处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be97b889b49b59b2",
      "translationZh": "将经过掩码处理的词元（以使用 CLIP-L/14 文本编码器计算出的提示词嵌入为条件）传入 U-ViT 模型，由该模型预测被掩码的图像块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0580b67438976084",
      "translationZh": "推理期间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0725b42974c7080",
      "translationZh": "使用 CLIP-L/14 文本编码器将输入提示词编码为嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e5322bd6ffbca30",
      "translationZh": "迭代直至达到 N 步：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51494984fabbbe0d",
      "translationZh": "从随机掩码的词元开始，将其与提示词嵌入一起传入 U-ViT 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3a4bf16a1ac819fc",
      "translationZh": "预测被掩码的词元，并根据 N 和掩码调度，仅保留一定比例的置信度最高的预测结果。对其余词元进行掩码处理，再将它们传入 U-ViT 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7affb54dd6dfd56b",
      "translationZh": "将最终输出传入 VQGAN 解码器，以获得最终图像。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "090adc2c4bf1c20e",
      "translationZh": "如开头所述，aMUSEd 借鉴了 MUSE 的许多设计。不过，两者也存在一些显著差异：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1325e657c03232a1",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd 不采用两阶段方法来预测最终的掩码图像块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d082ee43f25262b7",
      "translationZh": "不使用 T5 进行文本条件控制，而是使用 CLIP L/14 来计算文本嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de7619accfc32382",
      "translationZh": "仿照 Stable Diffusion XL (SDXL)，图像尺寸和裁剪等额外条件信息会被传递给 U-ViT。这被称为“微条件控制”（micro-conditioning）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94286fa504c4e438",
      "translationZh": "要进一步了解 aMUSEd，我们建议阅读此处的技术报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b38cd614c6965359",
      "translationZh": "在 🧨 diffusers 中使用 aMUSEd",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca34596f7fc9e146",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd 已完全集成到 🧨 diffusers 中。要使用它，我们首先需要安装相关库：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "153ee25e08fb2e41",
      "translationZh": "让我们从文本生成图像开始：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21b77943a8577f04",
      "translationZh": "我们可以研究在固定种子的情况下，num_inference_steps 如何影响图像质量：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f38b8cab3d6d03c",
      "translationZh": "关键在于，由于模型规模较小（仅约 ~800M 个参数，包括文本编码器和 VQ-GAN），aMUSEd 的速度非常快。下图对包括 aMUSEd 在内的不同模型的推理延迟进行了比较研究：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f66df815ca99cca3",
      "translationZh": "模型名称旁的元组采用以下格式：（时间步数，分辨率）。基准测试在 A100 上进行。更多详情请参阅技术报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5fbfad26dc67dc2",
      "translationZh": "作为其预训练目标的直接副产物，aMUSEd 可以以零样本方式进行图像修补，这与 SDXL 等其他模型不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a4eaf507972007e",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd 是 diffusers 中的首个非扩散系统。它采用迭代调度方法来预测被掩蔽的图像块，因此非常适合纳入 diffusers。我们很期待看到社区如何利用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91c97da01fe0bdf2",
      "translationZh": "我们鼓励你查阅技术报告，了解我们使用 aMUSEd 探索的所有任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e1a7c84bde3e6cd",
      "translationZh": "微调 aMUSEd",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67cc88767cb9945b",
      "translationZh": "我们提供了一个简单的训练脚本，用于在自定义数据集上微调 aMUSEd。使用 8-bit Adam 优化器和 float16 精度，只需略低于 11GBs 的 GPU 显存即可微调 aMUSEd。使用 LoRA，显存需求可进一步降至仅 7GBs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04a09245b392f096",
      "translationZh": "一个戴着红色方框眼镜的像素艺术角色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4aa7e9c9bfe3c02",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd 采用 OpenRAIL 许可证，因此便于针对商业用途进行改造。有关微调的更多详情，请参阅此目录。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69b1b67de5ef98be",
      "translationZh": "局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a96c5254484d4e5",
      "translationZh": "就图像质量而言，aMUSEd 并不是最先进的图像生成模型。我们发布 aMUSEd，是为了鼓励社区探索 MIM 等用于图像生成的非扩散框架。考虑到 MIM 具有以下优势，我们认为其潜力尚未得到充分探索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "df860e07874e5e3d",
      "translationZh": "推理效率高",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d80bc3fa4e75ceb",
      "translationZh": "体积更小，支持端侧应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c04153bbf8df465b",
      "translationZh": "无需昂贵的微调即可进行任务迁移",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e6857ba46572a84",
      "translationZh": "能够利用语言建模领域成熟组件的优势",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b36510be31d7e426",
      "translationZh": "（请注意，MUSE 的原始工作是闭源的）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6fcfe6c1c140571",
      "translationZh": "有关 aMUSEd 定量评估的详细说明，请参阅技术报告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65af8c8bf6f5b2ff",
      "translationZh": "我们希望社区能觉得这些资源有用，并受到激励，推动 MIM 在图像生成领域的进步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f7ad4772ec908ab",
      "translationZh": "论文：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45b2a67f94e12026",
      "translationZh": "Muse：通过掩码生成式 Transformer 实现文本到图像生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a47ba7802d3e2951",
      "translationZh": "aMUSEd：MUSE 的开放复现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4fcffd67bf3a2331",
      "translationZh": "利用统一的文本到文本 Transformer 探索迁移学习的极限（T5）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a6e65642ca13b7c7",
      "translationZh": "通过自然语言监督学习可迁移的视觉模型（CLIP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0320dfb78b4e81c",
      "translationZh": "SDXL：改进用于高分辨率图像合成的潜在扩散模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11b85e1eb671f6e6",
      "translationZh": "Simple diffusion：面向高分辨率图像的端到端扩散（U-ViT）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
